      "entitiesTitle": "Marktplatz-Übersicht — Domain Entity Map",
      "entitiesIntro": "The Marketplace module contains 13 domain entities across five functional areas: listings, developer portal, purchases, analytics, and reviews.",
      "categoryTitle": "Marktplatz-Übersicht — AppCategory Entity",
      "mappingTitle": "Marktplatz-Übersicht — AppCategoryMapping Entity",
      "mappingIntro": "Join entity implementing the many-to-many relationship between AppListing and AppCategory. An app can belong to multiple categories, and a category can contain multiple apps.",
      "architectureTitle": "Marktplatz-Übersicht — Entity Relationship Overview",
