      "description": "AppListing und AppScreenshot für die kommerzielle Präsentation und Galerie im Marktplatz.",
      "intro": "An AppListing is the storefront face of a Plugin. It carries everything a tenant sees in the catalog: name, tagline, icon, version, ratings, and install counts. Screenshots provide the visual gallery on the listing detail page.",
      "listingTitle": "App-Einträge & Screenshots — AppListing Entity",
      "listingIntro": "The central entity of the Marketplace module. It connects a Plugin to its commercial presence including pricing, reviews, screenshots, and install metrics. AverageRating and ReviewCount are denormalized for query performance and recalculated whenever a review is added or updated.",
